# find-untranslated.py rewrites these on every run, so tracking them means
# every suite run dirties the tree with output nobody reads from the repo.
# The report that matters is the printed one, and test-i18n-coverage.py's
# exit code is what the suite judges.
untranslated-report-*.json
# find-admin-untranslated.py's own output, same reasoning.
admin-untranslated-*.json
# dump-admin-blocks.py's own output -- regenerated whenever the panel's copy
# changes, and only ever read while writing rows.
admin-block-keys.json

# deploy/secrets.local.js holds the live MONGODB_URI/FIREBASE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT/
# ADMIN_KEY on the VPS (ecosystem.config.js requires it if present, see its
# own comment). It exists only there, created directly on the server, never
# via a commit -- this line is a backstop against an accidental `git add -A`
# picking it up on that machine.
deploy/secrets.local.js
